{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "写一篇立项论文  (Assigning a Case-Study Thesis)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Instead of letting Bu Xiaogu's industry reflections go to waste, Chun Yuqiao tells her to turn the greenlighting of his original show into a full research paper. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那写篇论文吧，就以孤岛争取立项的过程为案例。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你留意观察，整个过程当中一切的相关细节和资料，我全部向你开放。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，写论文干嘛用呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就当是工作任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我们的工作那么多，每天那么累。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您都忙得要没时间吃药了，写它干嘛呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "高级制作人不光只是干活，还要思考，要搞研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你的意思是，我也有机会升任高级制作人？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你能。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是您一定要多加保重身体！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那写篇论文吧，就以孤岛争取立项的过程为案例。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Write a thesis then, using Lonely Island's greenlighting journey as your case study.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你留意观察，整个过程当中一切的相关细节和资料，我全部向你开放。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Observe closely; I am opening every relevant detail and file in the whole process to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，写论文干嘛用呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, what would writing a thesis be for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就当是工作任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Treat it as an official work assignment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我们的工作那么多，每天那么累。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet we already have mountains of work and are exhausted every day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您都忙得要没时间吃药了，写它干嘛呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are too busy even to take your medicine—why write a paper on top of that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "高级制作人不光只是干活，还要思考，要搞研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A senior producer does more than just grind out tasks—you must think and do research.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你的意思是，我也有机会升任高级制作人？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you mean even I could one day become a senior producer?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你能。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是您一定要多加保重身体！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, you really must take extra care of your health!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那写篇论文吧，就以孤岛争取立项的过程为案例。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你留意观察，整个过程当中一切的相关细节和资料，我全部向你开放。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，写论文干嘛用呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就当是工作任务。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我们的工作那么多，每天那么累。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您都忙得要没时间吃药了，写它干嘛呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "高级制作人不光只是干活，还要思考，要搞研究。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你的意思是，我也有机会升任高级制作人？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你能。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是您一定要多加保重身体！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao's quiet assignment turns out to be the exact key Bu Xiaogu needs to reclaim her master's degree. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
